     3	    """You are given a string s.
     4	    if s[i] is a letter, reverse its case from lower to upper or vise versa, 
     5	    otherwise keep it as it is.
     6	    If the string contains no letters, reverse the string.
     7	    The function should return the resulted string.
     8	    Examples
     9	    solve("1234") = "4321"
    10	    solve("ab") = "AB"
    11	    solve("#a@C") = "#A@c"
    12	    """
